<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Borg-Warner Security.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Borg-Warner Security.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers analyst Jeffrey Kessler upgraded Borg-Warner Security Corp to outperform from neutral, his office confirmed.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1/4 at 13.</p>
